---
import LegalPage from "../components/LegalPage.astro";

const sections = [
  ["software", "The software"],
  ["providers", "Providers and user content"],
  ["acceptable-use", "Acceptable use"],
  ["warranty", "Warranty and liability"],
  ["privacy", "Privacy"],
  ["contact", "Contact"],
] as const;
---

<LegalPage
  title="Terms of Use - Akeru Bot"
  description="Draft terms for use of the Akeru Bot software and website."
  heading="Akeru Bot Terms of Use"
  lede="These draft terms cover the Akeru Bot software and website. The open-source license continues to govern the source code."
  status="Draft - counsel review required"
  lastUpdated="2026-08-31"
  sections={sections}
>
  <section id="software">
    <p class="section-number">01</p>
    <h2>The software</h2>
    <p>
      Akeru Bot is local-first, open-source software. The MIT License included with the repository
      governs your use, copying, modification, and distribution of the source code. These Terms do
      not create a hosted Akeru account or cloud service.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="providers">
    <p class="section-number">02</p>
    <h2>Providers and user content</h2>
    <p>
      You choose and configure each agent provider. You keep your rights in prompts, files, tool
      results, and other content. You must have permission to send that content to the selected
      provider. Provider terms, charges, output rules, and retention policies apply to its service.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="acceptable-use">
    <p class="section-number">03</p>
    <h2>Acceptable use</h2>
    <p>
      Do not use Akeru Bot to break the law, violate another person's rights, gain unauthorized
      access, distribute malware, or damage systems. You are responsible for reviewing commands,
      payments, messages, deletions, and production actions before you approve them.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="warranty">
    <p class="section-number">04</p>
    <h2>Warranty and liability</h2>
    <p>
      The software is provided under the warranty and liability terms in the MIT License. Agent
      output can be wrong or unsafe. Keep backups and review actions that can affect money, data,
      accounts, or production systems.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="privacy">
    <p class="section-number">05</p>
    <h2>Privacy</h2>
    <p>
      The <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a> lists local storage, outbound data, retention,
      and available controls.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="contact">
    <p class="section-number">06</p>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Report terms questions through the Akeru Bot repository. This draft must receive qualified
      legal counsel review before any public release.
    </p>
  </section>
</LegalPage>
